case a file name that climbs out of the root
target fake
covers 8
$ cov save ../../../escaped.cov
out 67
cov: '../../../escaped.cov' is outside the project sandbox (<ROOT>)
status 1
action none
$ cov load ../../../escaped.cov
out 67
cov: '../../../escaped.cov' is outside the project sandbox (<ROOT>)
status 1
action none
end
